This is my Harness
Copyright 2026 Formosa.dev

This product includes software developed at Formosa.dev (https://formosa.dev.ar).

This is my Harness is an open standard and toolchain for packaging,
distributing, validating and running portable agentic systems.

The project composes existing open standards (for example MCP, WebMCP,
MCP Apps, AG-UI, A2UI, A2A, Agent Skills, MCP Tasks, Arazzo, OpenTelemetry,
OCI/ORAS and Sigstore/Cosign) rather than redefining them. Those standards
remain governed by their respective projects and licenses.
